        "meaning": " <b>δείκνυμι</b>, δεικνύω (see Bl., § 23, 1; Veitch, see word), <BR /> [in LXX chiefly for רָאָה hi. ;] <BR /><b>to show</b>, with accusative of thing(s) (of person(s)), dative of person(s); <BR /> __(a) <b>to show, exhibit</b>: <ref='Mat.4.8; 8.4'>Mat.4:8 8:4</ref>, <ref='Mrk.1.44; 14.15'>Mrk.1:44 14:15</ref>, <ref='Luk.4.5; 5.14; 20.24; 22.12; 24.40'>Luk.4:5 5:14 20:24 22:12 24:40</ref>, <ref='Jhn.2.18; 5.20; 10.32; 20.20'>Jhn.2:18 5:20 10:32; 20:20</ref> <ref='Act.7.3'>Act.7:3</ref>\" (LXX), <ref='1Ti.6.15'>1Ti.6:15</ref>, <ref='Rev.17.1; 21.9, 10; 22.1, 8'>Rev.17:1 21:9, 10 22:1, 8</ref>, pass., <ref='Heb.8.5'>Heb.8:5</ref> (LXX); <BR /> __(b) <b>to make known</b>: <ref='Mat.16.21'>Mat.16:21</ref>, <ref='Jhn.14.8'>Jhn.14:8</ref>, 9, <ref='Act.10.28'>Act.10:28</ref>, <ref='1Co.12.31'>1Co.12:31</ref>, <ref='Rev.1.1; 4.1; 22.6'>Rev.1:1 4:1 22:6</ref>; <BR /> __(with) <b>to prove</b>: <ref='Jas.2.18; 3.13'>Jas.2:18 3:13</ref>.†<BR /> (AS)"
